## Additional Terms for Commercial Use

The core of ForgePilot (everything in this repository) is MIT licensed and free
for any use, including commercial self-hosting.

The following components are NOT covered by this MIT license and require a
separate commercial license:

- ForgePilot Cloud (managed hosting service at forgepilot.app)
- ForgePilot Teams (multi-tenancy, RBAC, admin panel)
- ForgePilot Enterprise (SSO, audit log, SLA, on-premise support)

If you want to offer ForgePilot as a hosted service to third parties,
please contact: sven.bittl@gmx.de

Everything you build on top of ForgePilot for your own use is yours.
